  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s9IcuV5.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/支持%20Minecraft%20版本-1.19%20%7C%201.18%20%7C%201.17%20%7C%201.16-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"386\" height=\"28\" />&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/安装方式-仅客户端-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"210\" height=\"28\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-mods-button/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689%3A7498\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📖 简介：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Better Mods Button</strong> 将模组按钮重新添加到暂停界面中，如同 Minecraft 1.13 之前的 Forge 版本那样，从而方便您快速访问游戏内的模组配置（前提是模组支持）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">此外，本模组还提供了多种位置与显示选项，让您能自定义模组按钮在屏幕上的呈现方式（深受 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a> 启发）。支持显示总模组数量，以及切换更新通知图标。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📷 截图展示：</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/897/2021-10-26_19.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/898/2021-10-26_19.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>标题屏幕的默认模组按钮</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>模组按钮的替代位置之一</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/899/2021-10-26_19.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/900/2021-10-26_19.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>暂停菜单的默认模组按钮</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>暂停屏幕的替代位置</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/403/901/2021-10-26_19.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>暂停屏幕的另一种按钮位置</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>💡 常见问题：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>问：如何配置此模组？</strong><br /><strong>答：</strong>安装我的 <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a> 模组，即可在游戏内直接配置！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>问：有 Fabric 版本吗？</strong><br /><strong>答：</strong>请使用由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/prospectordev\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>ProspectorDev</strong></span></a> 开发的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a> 模组。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>🏆 致谢：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Better Mods Button 的开发受到了以下启发和帮助：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/prospectordev\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>ProspectorDev</strong></span></a>，其模组 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a> 为本模组的大部分配置选项提供了灵感。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&message=LunaPixelStudios&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs_&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzss&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=@Fusseel&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/user/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=u/Fusseel&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=reddit&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs%200212&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<table style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kiHP8s9.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OVV5lXk.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UzgNFIB.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DCwxKZU.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/console-experience\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aXWOS7B.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DTzDrbm.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mU9OlhP.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-age-combat\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sHiR309.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/air-hop\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MinxlVJ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zWJSzhi.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
